      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHARKA (5) looks the horse to beat after putting a clear gap on them in a BM64 here last time. Gets in light again with the rise in grade and can repeat the dose over the shorter journey. THE WIRRULLA BOY (4) is the key danger, having resumed with a barnstorming win over this course and distance at the latest. Will likely drift back again and betaking the strongest strides late. OUR DIVINYL (3) was slow away and covered ground when fifth behind THE WIRRULLA BOY, but the form around him last campaign when ridden aggressively keeps him right in the mix. Expect Brewster to be much more positive on him second-up from the low draw. PICK 'N' MIX (2) was fourth behind THE WIRRULLA BOY last start after sitting in the right spot, and her earlier BM64 second at this venue keeps her in the mix if she finds a sharper finish.",
